# DS5002: the only numeric column is the explicit x, so nothing is left for y.
mode: check
schema: t(customerId: string, month: datetime, revenue: real, n: long)
---- query
from t
| project customerId, revenue
| render scatterchart with (xcolumn = revenue)
---- expected
error[DS5002]: `scatterchart` needs a numeric column for the y-axis, but every one already fills another role
  --> query:3:10
  |
3 | | render scatterchart with (xcolumn = revenue)
  |          ^^^^^^^^^^^^ no column for the y-axis
  |
  = help: compute one with `extend` or `summarize` before `render`
  = note: the result's columns: customerId: string, revenue: real
